  "title": "Slow-Cooker Fish Chowder",
  "description": "A creamy chowder full of shrimp, scallops, and chunks of halibut gets hearty flavor and a touch of sweetness from sweet corn, potatoes, and bacon.",
  "authors": [
    "KathrynG"
  ],
